    "Adjust in 1% steps or enter a value. Position ranges from one edge to the other; 50% is centered. Mouse changes are also saved. Settings apply immediately. A full-size panel cannot be repositioned. A minimum size keeps the content readable.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adjust in 1% steps or enter a value. Position ranges from one edge to the other; 50% is centered. Mouse changes are also saved. Settings apply immediately. A full-size panel cannot be repositioned. A minimum size keeps the content readable."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1%単位で調整・数値入力できます。位置は移動できる範囲の端から端（50%が中央）です。マウスで移動・サイズ変更した結果も保存されます。設定変更はすぐ反映され、画面いっぱいのサイズでは位置は動きません。読みやすさを保つため最小サイズがあります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After you close the panel, it stays closed until a new request arrives. Connection errors do not close it. Automatic display waits while Settings is open.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After you close the panel, it stays closed until a new request arrives. Connection errors do not close it. Automatic display waits while Settings is open."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "手動で閉じた後は、新しい許可待ちが届くまで開き直しません。接続エラーでは閉じません。設定画面を開いている間は自動操作を待ちます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
