    "Transparency controls the background tint; blur strength controls how much frosted glass is blended in. At 100% transparency and 0% blur, the background is clear. Text and buttons stay opaque. Changes are saved automatically.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transparency controls the background tint; blur strength controls how much frosted glass is blended in. At 100% transparency and 0% blur, the background is clear. Text and buttons stay opaque. Changes are saved automatically."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "透明度は背景色の濃さ、ぼかしの強さはすりガラス効果の混ざり具合を調整します。透明度100%・ぼかし0%で背後が直接見えます。文字やボタンの濃さは変わりません。変更は自動保存されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
